==Battleground==
*8 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Relic Doge]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Zackie Peng]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*3 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Oldstrich]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**1 [[Othom]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
**3 [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**2 [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is relatively tame all things considered, minus the Dagshunds being 1440% buffed giving them '''864,000 HP''' which could catch players off guard. Aside from that, this is arguably the simplest Oldstrich appearance yet, as options such as [[Fried Chicken Cat]] and [[Esoteric Uril]] can disable Othom's curse, with the former also being able to disable Oldstrich's toxic if sufficiently stacked. [[Master of Life Dr. Nova (Special Cat)|Master of Life Dr. Nova]] is useful as well for dealing damage and slowing the Oldstrich in the process.

==Trivia==
*Temple of Manga's Japanese name, Ma-Ga Jiin (マ=ガ寺院, "Ma-Ga Temple"), is a pun on マガジン ''magajin'' (magazine) and 寺院 ''jiin'' (temple). The presence of [[Othom]] may be related to how ガ ''ga'' can mean moth.

